00:19:58.030 --> 00:19:59.420
And I thought, you know,

496
00:19:59.420 --> 00:20:01.290
this thing that happened to George Floyd,

497
00:20:01.290 --> 00:20:06.290
people probably exclude me from that category of person.

498
00:20:06.500 --> 00:20:09.150
Like obviously I'm a black person,

