510
00:20:33.890 --> 00:20:35.690
And so I spoke to that, you know,

511
00:20:35.690 --> 00:20:38.900
cause I'm from Alabama and a part of being from Alabama,

512
00:20:38.900 --> 00:20:41.710
which was the staging point

