unity and wholeness and any number

790
00:32:07.190 --> 00:32:10.500
of other mystical factors that apply

791
00:32:10.500 --> 00:32:11.970
to that specific number,

792
00:32:11.970 --> 00:32:14.440
including the number of beads on any Mala

