807
00:32:53.630 --> 00:32:57.150
And so I wanted it to have that kind of feeling

808
00:32:57.150 --> 00:32:59.773
and level of engagement with people.

809
00:33:01.468 --> 00:33:03.250
And I feel like we've succeeded in that.

810
00:33:03.250 --> 00:33:05.620
We painstakingly went over every single detail.

811
00:33:05.620 --> 00:33:07.100
Like there's literally no detail

812
00:33:07.100 --> 00:33:09.500
in any of those pages that we didn't

