00:33:37.610 --> 00:33:39.460
but they're powerful lessons.

823
00:33:39.460 --> 00:33:42.440
It's a book about all kinds of things.

824
00:33:42.440 --> 00:33:44.410
Kindness, patience.

825
00:33:44.410 --> 00:33:45.610
Relations.
Reflection,

826
00:33:45.610 --> 00:33:48.140
relationships, gratitude, trust, faith.

827
00:33:48.140 --> 00:33:49.040
Everything we struggle with.

828
00:33:49.040 --> 00:33:50.400
Small gestures.

829
00:33:50.400 --> 00:33:51.720
Compassion.

830
00:33:51.720 --> 00:33:52.553
Everything we struggle with

831
00:33:52.553 --> 00:33:55.050
on a daily moment-to-moment basis.

832
00:33:55.050 --> 00:33:57.490
Almost anything you're conflicted with right now,

833
00:33:57.490 --> 00:33:58.770
if you crack the book open,

834
00:33:58.770 --> 00:34:00.550
you can probably find,

835
00:34:00.550 --> 00:34:02.970
and I tell people this is not about giving you the answer,

