00:34:47.670 --> 00:34:51.730
and kind of foreshadowed the life to come,

852
00:34:51.730 --> 00:34:54.340
even if you are not consciously aware

853
00:34:54.340 --> 00:34:56.350
of how it would play out.

854
00:34:56.350 --> 00:34:57.910
Yeah, I wasn't consciously aware,

855
00:34:57.910 --> 00:34:59.920
but obviously in hindsight,

856
00:34:59.920 --> 00:35:04.810
I feel very fortunate to have had that kind of experience.

857
00:35:04.810 --> 00:35:06.320
And in such an obvious way.

858
00:35:06.320 --> 00:35:09.800
So what you're referring to is I was,

