868
00:35:31.560 --> 00:35:34.330
And I spent my last little money

869
00:35:34.330 --> 00:35:36.400
on a one-way ticket to Paris.

870
00:35:36.400 --> 00:35:38.530
Not really knowing anyone there,

871
00:35:38.530 --> 00:35:40.570
not speaking the language,

872
00:35:40.570 --> 00:35:45.140
just really a leap of faith in every sense of that phrase,

