00:35:45.140 --> 00:35:48.660
and landed in Paris and ended up,

874
00:35:48.660 --> 00:35:52.000
on the first day, ended up running into

875
00:35:52.000 --> 00:35:54.550
some friends of mine from college.

876
00:35:54.550 --> 00:35:56.487
Hold on, I'm going to interrupt you,

877
00:35:56.487 --> 00:35:58.410
And we got to back up a little bit,

878
00:35:58.410 --> 00:36:01.000
'cause there's two things that immediately pop

