883
00:36:10.230 --> 00:36:13.290
Like what was the, you know,

884
00:36:13.290 --> 00:36:15.020
conscious awareness around that?

885
00:36:15.020 --> 00:36:16.160
Like, it was this knowing,

886
00:36:16.160 --> 00:36:18.680
like you just had to do this thing.

887
00:36:18.680 --> 00:36:21.140
You knew on paper, it was kind of insane.

888
00:36:21.140 --> 00:36:23.010
You didn't even want to tell your mom what you were doing.

889
00:36:23.010 --> 00:36:24.610
You told her you had a job in Paris,

890
00:36:24.610 --> 00:36:27.370
but you had this compulsion

891
00:36:27.370 --> 00:36:29.450
that you couldn't ignore

892
00:36:29.450 --> 00:36:31.860
that motivated this whole thing.

893
00:36:31.860 --> 00:36:34.750
Yeah, it was a thought that would not go away.

894
00:36:34.750 --> 00:36:38.090
And now I realize that whenever you have a thought

895
00:36:38.090 --> 00:36:41.940
that feels charming to your heart,

896
00:36:41.940 --> 00:36:43.260
and it doesn't go away,

897
00:36:43.260 --> 00:36:46.130
that's an indication from the universe,

898
00:36:46.130 --> 00:36:47.877
in quotes, "the universe,"

899
00:36:48.820 --> 00:36:50.940
to move in that direction.

900
00:36:50.940 --> 00:36:53.180
It doesn't mean that you're necessarily

901
00:36:53.180 --> 00:36:56.160
meant to fulfill that completely,

902
00:36:56.160 --> 00:36:59.040
but just take a step or two in that direction,

903
00:36:59.040 --> 00:37:02.490
and then the next instructions will come to you

904
00:37:02.490 --> 00:37:04.160
once you start moving in that direction.

905
00:37:04.160 --> 00:37:07.330
Sure, it's one thing to have that sense,

