00:37:07.330 --> 00:37:09.930
and it's another thing to trust it,

907
00:37:09.930 --> 00:37:12.260
or to take action on it.

908
00:37:12.260 --> 00:37:14.440
Especially as a young person

909
00:37:14.440 --> 00:37:16.660
who's got all this social programming around,

910
00:37:16.660 --> 00:37:18.770
like you got to get the job and here's what you do,

911
00:37:18.770 --> 00:37:20.870
and this is how it's gonna play out.

912
00:37:20.870 --> 00:37:22.910
So there's something about you

913
00:37:22.910 --> 00:37:26.140
that I think is unique in your ability

