00:37:33.890 --> 00:37:35.660
Well there was some fear there too, you know,

918
00:37:35.660 --> 00:37:38.350
like I wasn't all courageous and like, you know,

919
00:37:38.350 --> 00:37:40.080
like I definitely was skeptical.

920
00:37:40.080 --> 00:37:41.480
I definitely had doubts.

921
00:37:41.480 --> 00:37:45.713
I definitely didn't know what was gonna happen,

922
00:37:47.510 --> 00:37:50.920
but I had been

923
00:37:52.000 --> 00:37:55.190
testing the waters

924
00:37:55.190 --> 00:37:57.410
with following that voice,

925
00:37:57.410 --> 00:38:00.340
for a few years prior to that,

926
00:38:00.340 --> 00:38:03.103
even in university, I remember I was,

