1030
00:41:53.830 --> 00:41:55.380
who turned around and goes, oh my God!

1031
00:41:55.380 --> 00:41:56.213
What are you doing here?

1032
00:41:56.213 --> 00:41:58.240
He didn't know that she knew you?

