00:42:17.262 --> 00:42:18.095
It was the same morning.

1045
00:42:18.095 --> 00:42:19.820
It was within two hours of arriving.

1046
00:42:21.405 --> 00:42:22.607
And I had an apartment,

1047
00:42:22.607 --> 00:42:23.500
I had friends.

1048
00:42:23.500 --> 00:42:28.500
