1049
00:42:28.519 --> 00:42:29.993
I mean that's a powerful lesson.

1050
00:42:29.993 --> 00:42:31.455
You're like, okay.

1051
00:42:31.455 --> 00:42:32.288
I had everything.

1052
00:42:32.288 --> 00:42:33.970
This trust in the universe thing,

1053
00:42:33.970 --> 00:42:37.090
