It's like maybe look at it this way,

2970
02:00:04.790 --> 02:00:05.850
and then, you know,

2971
02:00:05.850 --> 02:00:08.263
circle back to me in a year, right?

2972
02:00:11.100 --> 02:00:11.933
Yeah.

2973
02:00:11.933 --> 02:00:13.160
Well, congrats on the book.

2974
02:00:14.501 --> 02:00:15.790
It's a beautiful thing.

2975
